(7766333, 1287974, 173844, '<td valign="top">
Music for the eyes.  One could say that the three elements, flowers and petals, yellow-green reeds and dark shadows of the reeds, are an harmonious chord. The water feels more like sky than water, at least for me.  Each element can take a bow as they come forward and settle back.  Lovely.  Camera as brush.
<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Music for the eyes.  One could say that the three elements, flowers and petals, yellow-green reeds and dark shadows of the reeds, are an harmonious chord. The water feels more like sky than water, at least for me.  Each element can take a bow as they come forward and settle back.  Lovely.  Camera as brush.
Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2024-05-12 22:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7766334, 1288034, 173844, '<td valign="top">
Intense dark water, adorned and bespangled, it''s a lesson in what''s possible, of what a saturation of nature and life offers.  As much, and perhaps more so, is the inclination to untether ones eyes and let the image go abstract.  
<br/>That''s a pure joy, a nourishment of soul and spirit.  Ten for them both.
<br/>Personal second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Intense dark water, adorned and bespangled, it''s a lesson in what''s possible, of what a saturation of nature and life offers.  As much, and perhaps more so, is the inclination to untether ones eyes and let the image go abstract.  
That''s a pure joy, a nourishment of soul and spirit.  Ten for them both.
Personal second favorite of the challenge.', '2024-05-12 22:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7766336, 1288018, 173844, '<td valign="top">
Awesome low key image, only brought out more by the balancing dark trees and reflections on the left.  Beautiful tones.</td>', 'Awesome low key image, only brought out more by the balancing dark trees and reflections on the left.  Beautiful tones.', '2024-05-12 22:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7766337, 1288019, 173844, '<td valign="top">
